<!doctype html>
<html class="no-js" lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, height=device-height, minimum-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="{{ settings.timer_bar_color }}">

    {%- comment -%}
      Tracking. A UTMify inicializa o pixel Meta 1515257673167685.
      Substitui os dois loaders ofuscados (base64+XOR) do tema original.
      O stub de fbq que descartava InitiateCheckout/AddPaymentInfo/Purchase foi removido.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.utmify.com.br">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://connect.facebook.net">

    {%- comment -%}
      Stub de fila do Meta, padrao oficial e SEM filtro. Duas razoes para ele existir:
      1. o tema original definia window.fbq de forma sincrona no topo do head; sem nada aqui,
         um app que chame fbq() durante o parse estoura ReferenceError em vez de enfileirar;
      2. o stub original trazia 3 ifs que DESCARTAVAM Purchase, InitiateCheckout e
         AddPaymentInfo quando faltava order_id. Como a UTMify nao envia order_id, o fundo
         de funil inteiro morria em silencio. Aqui a fila e neutra: nao filtra nada.
      O init do pixel fica por conta da UTMify (pixel Meta 1515257673167685); nao chamamos
      init aqui para nao duplicar PageView.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <script>
      !function(f,b,e,v,n,t,s){if(f.fbq)return;n=f.fbq=function(){n.callMethod?
      n.callMethod.apply(n,arguments):n.queue.push(arguments)};if(!f._fbq)f._fbq=n;
      n.push=n;n.loaded=!0;n.version='2.0';n.queue=[]}(window,document,'script',
      'https://connect.facebook.net/en_US/fbevents.js');
    </script>

    <script>window.pixelId = "6a68c53e8f4005f76c905804";</script>
    <script src="https://cdn.utmify.com.br/scripts/pixel/pixel.js" async defer></script>
    <script
      src="https://cdn.utmify.com.br/scripts/utms/latest.js"
      data-utmify-prevent-xcod-sck
      data-utmify-prevent-subids
      async defer></script>

    {%- capture seo_page_title -%}
      {%- if request.page_type == 'search' and search.terms != blank -%}
        {{ search.terms | split: ' AND ' | last | split: 'product_type:' | last }} - {{ shop.name }}
      {%- else -%}
        {{ page_title }}{% if current_tags %}{% assign meta_tags = current_tags | join: ', ' %} &ndash; {{ 'general.meta.tags' | t: tags: meta_tags }}{% endif %}{% if current_page != 1 %} &ndash; {{ 'general.meta.page' | t: page: current_page }}{% endif %}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endcapture -%}

    <title>{{- seo_page_title -}}</title>

    {%- if page_description -%}
      <meta name="description" content="{{ page_description | escape }}">
    {%- endif -%}

    <link rel="canonical" href="{{ canonical_url }}">

    {%- if settings.favicon -%}
      <link rel="shortcut icon" href="{{ settings.favicon | img_url: '96x96' }}" type="image/png">
    {%- endif -%}

    {% render 'social-meta-tags' %}

    {%- comment -%}Few prefech to increase performance on commonly used third-parties{%- endcomment -%}
    <link rel="preload" as="style" href="{{ 'theme.css' | asset_url }}">
    <link rel="preload" as="style" href="{{ 'custom.css' | asset_url }}">
    <link rel="preload" as="script" href="{{ 'theme.min.js' | asset_url }}">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.shopify.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.shopifycdn.com">
    {% render 'css-variables' %}
    {{ content_for_header }}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'theme.css' | asset_url }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'custom.css' | asset_url }}">
    {% render 'microdata-schema' %}
    {%- comment -%}
      Removido um IntersectionObserver que varria TODAS as <img> de toda pagina procurando
      a classe 'lazy'. O tema usa 'lazyload' (lazysizes, ja no theme.min.js), e
      classList.contains('lazy') nao casa com 'lazyload' - o observer nunca fazia nada.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <script>
      // This allows to expose several variables to the global scope, to be used in scripts
      window.theme = {
        pageType: {{ request.page_type | json }},
        cartCount: {{ cart.item_count | json }},
        moneyFormat: {{ shop.money_format | json }},
        moneyWithCurrencyFormat: {{ shop.money_with_currency_format | json }},
        showDiscount: {% if settings.show_discount %}true{% else %}false{% endif %},
        discountMode: {{ settings.discount_mode | json }},
        searchMode: {{ settings.search_mode | json }},
        cartType: {{ settings.cart_type | json }}
      };

      window.routes = {
        rootUrl: {{ routes.root_url | json }},
        rootUrlWithoutSlash: {% if routes.root_url == '/' %}''{% else %}{{ routes.root_url | json }}{% endif %},
        cartUrl: {{ routes.cart_url | json }},
        cartAddUrl: {{ routes.cart_add_url | json }},
        cartChangeUrl: {{ routes.cart_change_url | json }},
        searchUrl: {{ routes.search_url | json }},
        productRecommendationsUrl: {{ routes.product_recommendations_url | json }},
        productsCatalogUrl: {{ 'products-catalog.json' | asset_url | json }}
      };

      window.languages = {
        productRegularPrice: {{ 'product.general.regular_price' | t | json }},
        productSalePrice: {{ 'product.general.sale_price' | t | json }},
        collectionOnSaleLabel: {{ 'collection.product.discount_html' | t | json }},
        productFormUnavailable: {{ 'product.form.unavailable' | t | json }},
        productFormAddToCart: {% if product.template_suffix == 'pre-order' %}{{ 'product.form.pre_order' | t | json }}{% else %}{{ 'product.form.add_to_cart' | t | json }}{% endif %},
        productFormSoldOut: {{ 'product.form.sold_out' | t | json }},
        productAdded: {{ 'product.form.added' | t | json }},
        productAddedShort: {{ 'product.form.added_short' | t | json }},
        shippingEstimatorNoResults: {{ 'cart.shipping_estimator.no_results_title' | t | json }},
        shippingEstimatorOneResult: {{ 'cart.shipping_estimator.one_result_title' | t | json }},
        shippingEstimatorMultipleResults: {{ 'cart.shipping_estimator.multiple_results_title' | t | json }},
        shippingEstimatorErrors: {{ 'cart.shipping_estimator.errors' | t | json }}
      };

      window.lazySizesConfig = {
        loadHidden: false,
        hFac: 0.8,
        expFactor: 3,
        customMedia: {
          '--phone': '(max-width: 640px)',
          '--tablet': '(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1023px)',
          '--lap': '(min-width: 1024px)'
        }
      };

      document.documentElement.className = document.documentElement.className.replace('no-js', 'js');
    </script>

    <script src="{{ 'theme.min.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

    {%- comment -%}
      Font Awesome removido: era o CSS inteiro (14KB + webfont ~90KB) para 2 icones,
      e a familia pedida no custom.css ("Font Awesome 5 Free") nem existia na v6,
      entao o icone do botao de compra renderizava como quadradinho.
      Os 2 icones viraram SVG inline no custom.css.
    {%- endcomment -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      jQuery mantido sincrono de proposito: 13 arquivos .liquid e o custom.js usam $()
      em scripts inline que rodam durante o parse. Com defer, todos quebram.
      Trocado o CDN code.jquery.com (3.6.0) pelo asset local jquery.js (3.7.1, ja existia
      no tema sem uso) para tirar DNS+TLS de origem externa do caminho critico.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <script src="{{ 'jquery.js' | asset_url }}"></script>

    <script src="{{ 'jquery.mask.min.js' | asset_url }}"></script>{%- comment -%} era cdnjs: origem externa a menos no caminho critico {%- endcomment -%}
    <script src="{{ 'custom.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

    {%- if request.page_type != 'cart' -%}
        <script>
            (function () {
              window.onpageshow = function() {
                // We force re-freshing the cart content onpageshow, as most browsers will serve a cache copy when hitting the
                // back button, which cause staled data
                document.documentElement.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('cart:refresh', {
                  bubbles: true,
                  detail: {scrollToTop: false}
                }));
              };

            })();
      </script>
    {%- endif -%}
    {% render 'mrk-style' %}
  </head>

  <body class="Evolution--v2.2 {% if settings.animation_image_zoom %}features--animate-zoom{% endif%} template-{{ request.page_type | handle }} {% if request.page_type contains '/' %}template-{{ request.page_type | split: '/' | last | handle }}{% endif %}"
    data-instant-intensity="viewport">

    <a href="#main" class="visually-hidden skip-to-content">{{ 'general.accessibility.skip_to_content' | t }}</a>
    <span class="loading-bar"></span>

    {% section 'announcement-bar' %}

    {% section 'ad-banner' %}

    {%- unless request.page_type == 'cart' -%}
      {%- comment -%}As required by Shopify rules, popup must be removed on cart page to remove distraction{%- endcomment -%}
      {% section 'popups' %}
    {%- endunless -%}

    {% section 'header' %}

    <main id="main" role="main">
      {{ content_for_layout }}
    </main>

    {% section 'info-bar' %}

    {% section 'newsletter-bar' %}
    {% section 'footer' %}
    {% section 'support-floating' %}

    <ul hidden>
      <li id="a11y-new-window-message">{{ 'general.accessibility.new_window' | t }}</li>
    </ul>

    {%- comment -%}
      Bloqueio de F12/botao direito removido: desativava tambem onselectstart, entao o
      cliente nao conseguia copiar cupom, e-mail do SAC nem codigo de rastreio, e no
      celular atrapalhava o toque longo. Nao protegia nada (o HTML e publico).
      A opcao block_f12_right_button continua no schema; agora nao tem efeito.
    {%- endcomment -%}

    <style>
      {% if settings.enable_line_below_heading %}
        .section__title::after {
          content: '';
          display: flex;
          bottom: 0;
          left: 0;
          right: 0;
          background: var(--header-accent-color);
          height: 7px;
          width: 120px;
          margin-top: -5px;
          border-radius: 20px;
        }
      {% endif %}
    </style>
    {%- comment -%}
      Removidos 4 @import do Google Fonts (Rubik, Roboto, Montserrat, Poppins) que
      ficavam no fim do body: nenhuma era usada pelo tema (a tipografia vem do
      font_picker do Shopify) e cada @import serializava mais uma requisicao.
    {%- endcomment -%}

  



<!-- Blocos 'vega utm script' e 'vega cart script' removidos.
     Eram residuo do tema clonado da loja Olivia Delicata: reescreviam o action do
     formulario do carrinho para https://pay.oliviadelicata.shop (dominio NAO registrado,
     livre para qualquer um comprar) e gravavam cookie de UTM em dominio de terceiro.
     O checkout e responsabilidade exclusiva do snippet Corvex abaixo. -->
<!-- Código essencial do Corvex Checkout. Não remova. -->
{% capture corvex_snippet %}{% render 'Corvex' %}{% endcapture %}
{% if corvex_snippet contains 'Liquid error' %}
  {%- comment -%} Evita erro de renderização {%- endcomment -%}
{% else %}
  {% render 'Corvex' %}
{% endif %}
<!-- Código essencial do Horizon Checkout. Não remova. -->
</body>
</html>